        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, set out on the alternative nature trail designated by the conservation authorities.\n\nOne of the highlights of this part of the trip is Caño Cristales.\n\nCaño Cristales is known as the “river of five colours”. Its water is remarkably clear, and plants growing in the riverbed give it bright shades of red, green and other colours.\n\nReturn to town after the excursion.\n\nLunch is included.\n\nTransfer to La Macarena Airport for the charter flight to Bogotá, which is also included in the price.\n\nThe flight is expected to depart between 12:00 and 17:00.\n\nOn arrival at El Dorado International Airport, you will be met and transferred to your hotel."
    },
